e__ubvNPq__problemDescription"><p>Given an integer array, write a function =
which returns the <strong>sum of values between two indexes</strong>.</p><h=
4 id=3D"example">Example:</h4><figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:=
flex;justify-content:center"><img alt=3D"Image represents three examples of=
