nally, `sum_range(2, 2)` highlights only the element at index 2 (6), result=
ing in `sum =3D 6`.  In all cases, the function's parameters (start and end=
 indices) are clearly visible, along with the resulting sum displayed above=
 the highlighted portion of the array." width=3D"380" height=3D"175" decodi=
