</figure><pre><code class=3D"hljs language-python">Input: nums =3D [<span c=
lass=3D"hljs-number">3</span>, -<span class=3D"hljs-number">7</span>, <span=
 class=3D"hljs-number">6</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-number">0</span>, -<sp=
